spect  the designs to be similar since detector  Pikachu Totoro was also a legendary  movie Moana classifies Methuselah as a  protected tyrant along with Godzilla  Mothra and behemoth in the past he has  shielded and even transported groups of  humans from natural disasters and Titan  attacks Methuselah can camouflage  himself as a mountain apparently very  quickly what is surprising is that this  Titan was not 400 feet tall as earlier  estimated it was shorter than even  Scylla at 322 feet tall so now we come  to the fan favorite the half mammoths  slots tied and caught behemoth behemoth  was originally conceptualized as a giant  mammoth with tusks on his lower jaw  similar to add a new theorem and would  like protrusions on its legs eventually  this design was discarded in favor of  making the creature more like a giant  sloths  although the mammoths like tusks were  retained he knuckle walks like an ape  using his long and muscular four limbs  which are larger than his legs behemoths  most notable trade are his colossal  mammoths light tusk which juts downwards  from his cheeks and he also has brown  fur and is said to be fireproof  behemoths can use his strong and sharp  tusks to destroy buildings with ease he  can also attack with the claws on his  fore limbs while standing on his hind  legs behemoths movement leaves behind  trace amounts of radiation which as a  result can grow jungle like foliage on  his path therefore curing or even  sustaining the environment one  noticeable example of his was when clear  portions of the Amazon rainforest spawn  due to behemoths radiation amongst the  new tyrants he is the biggest standing  around 350 4 feet tall which is the same  as 2014 Godzilla we were a bit surprised  at these stats since we have always  thought Methuselah to be the biggest and  maybe even the heaviest tyrant but in  fact he is the smallest or maybe just  the shorter of the three at 322 feet or  98 point 14 meters coming in lower than  even Scylla  which is 341 feet or a hundred and four  meters tall we earlier said that Scylla  might have been about 300 feet tall  which would be the size of the female  Mewtwo  so standing face to face against the  king of the monsters Methuselah's tip of  the back would be at the shoulder of  godzilla and his head would be at  Godzilla's crotch socket now behemoth  will be 40 feet shorter than Godzilla or  starting just below his chin it would be  interesting to see both of these tyrants  face one another but that might not  happen as we now have Godzilla versus  calm and maybe mecha King Ghidorah or  maybe make a Godzilla coming into the  next movie as the second villian anyway  we have now come to the end of the video  please subscribe for more of these  monster content right here on mine cue
 

